profile_default/
ipython_config.py

# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to comit these files.
#   For an app on the other hand, they are typically ignored.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if development is done on different OSes, lock failures may occur.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock is generally recommended, but may be ignored in some cases.
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock is generally recommended, but may be ignored in some cases.
# pdm.lock

